1dcacf",17,-5,1,"Should we consider recording successes as well? This way, it will easy to check the health of the API with a single histogram."],["6966db22_8150a537",35,-5,1,"This part is a minor detail - move it to the end of the description."],["e807aab0_c5719478",17,-5,1,"`Platform` and `Synchronous` seem redundant here, consider renaming to `GetAccountsAndroidResult`."],["f552816b_a45690b4",35,-5,1,"This will go away after the launch is over, consider omitting to avoid the need to rewrite the description."],["7162a137_c844ec5b",35,-3,1,"[Nit] This histogram is likely to stay - should we expand the description a bit more (e.g., mention that this pertains to the account list fetches from the platform-specific API that happen in the…"],["cb7116e6_ac38d934",35,-3,1,"Per histogram guidance, the description of the histogram should explain when it is recorded. Fine to use the same sentence as in the histogram above (\"Recorded when the availability check…"],["e23090aa_53345775",17,-3,1,"[Nit] For these values - please consider adding `Error` suffix to make it clear that we're talking about unsuccessful invocations."]],0,237],[7099021,20423,287,7.579,6.176,[[5,0.465,21,133],[0,0.248,45,70],[3,0.221,25,66],[2,0.066,74,18]],[["",36,-31,1],["",36,-31,1],["",37,-31,1],["",36,-31,1],["",36,-31,1],["",36,-31,1],["",36,-31,0],["2a83dae7_4ce21b35",38,-10,1,"This seems to be a pretty common pattern here, should we consider creating a helper for this: ``` bool WebSigninTracker::MatchesRequestedAccount(const CoreAccountId& account_id, const std::string&…"],["3bb91a7e_534d0e30",39,-10,0,"[Nit] This is likely to be confusing for callers of this constructor. Should we consider overloading the constructor instead (or making it private and using factory methods instead)?"],["55c3757e_19695ce6",40,-10,1,"[Nit] Confusing name, please consider a different one."],["7ebee6b3_d4b177a9",38,-10,1,"Ditto."],["8c054249_362ecf09",38,-10,1,"[Predates this CL, but seems reasonable to address] Looks like we only care about valid accounts here, consider changing to `GetValidSignedInAccounts` and dropping explicit `valid` checks in this…"],["a6514a8c_a6b5a346",38,-10,1,"Seems unintentional."],["b33a1b82_1102f417",39,-10,1,"Nit: add a comment to clarify the meaning of both parts of the variant."],["b73f4d43_e371bcc8",38,-10,1,"I think it makes sense to start to observe the reconcilor after we're sure that the account is available in the IdentityManager (the same applies to `OnStateChanged` call below)."],["c7b7bd8e_eece717a",38,-10,1,"Ditto: unintentional."],["44eab6c1_c14de9ed",41,-5,1,"I think this should it be in a different CL."],["46e4c8cf_5ea71615",40,-5,1,"[Nit] Rename to `createWithCoreAccountId` (and change the parameter type accordingly)."],["c9b0959d_dc606967",36,-5,1,"You're checking the tab URL after the account was added. Would it make sense to grab the URL at the time the flow was started (i.e., in the beginning of `startAddAccountFlow`)?"],["d9a1bf51_9f227b88",38,-5,1,"If we do this - we should not call `OnStateChanged` in this method. However, before you do this, I think I have a slightly different proposal. How about we ignore all state changes if the requested…"],["e0e33d63_769012f8",38,-5,1,"[Nit] Good catch, thanks! I think we can remove the comment now."],["2061ce2c_e4ea5c5d",36,-3,1,"[Minor nit] Consider renaming this to make it more clear that the redirect doesn't happen immediately, but rather after waiting for cookies (e.g., `waitForCookiesAndRedirect`)."],["59888869_6cfe71e5",42,-3,1,"Move above to be with other non-JNI includes."],["835ce69b_bd4b9048",12,-3,1,"[Nit] Please wrap to 72 characters."],["c060eca2_be655eaa",42,-3,1,"[Nit] Per documentation it is recommended to use `CHECK` instead: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/main/styleguide/c++/checks.md#invariant_verification-mechanisms."],["ca459f93_bc191de7",43,-3,1,"[Nit] Please add a TODO to clarify that we might need to do a reauth flow or a wait for cookies in this scenario."]],0,238],[7228982,20430,286,7.579,6.176,[[5,0.467,22,133],[0,0.245,46,69],[3,0.222,26,66],[2,0.066,75,18]],[],0,239],[7185058,20437,78,2.448,1.983,[[0,0.72,47,56],[1,0.28,37,22]],[["22253b15_e54edcc2",35,-4,1,"tiny nit: could we remove the period for consistency with other descriptions? 🙏"],["a27b905e_ef7ec222",35,-4,1,"is it rather something like \"proceed to cookies loading (after an account is added or after a successful web-sign-in sign-in\" IIUC? It seems that the `WebSigninBridge` can also be created…"],["cc1e7e3f_6a9b4535",35,-4,1,"nit: would you mind extending a bit on what's the result here? (as the histogram description needs to be readable by people without detailed context)"],["fca75a01_39baa403",35,0,1,"Question: Should we mention add account as well? (For my knowledge: is the AddSession account adding considered a \"web sign-in\" as we don't sign-in in Chrome?)"]],0,240]]}